@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-60 - Disable User

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Admin Users UI" as FE
control "AuthController" as API
control "UsersService" as Service
database "MongoDB: users, role" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-60
FE -> API: Disable user endpoint recommended
API -> Service: Execute Disable User
Service -> DB: Read/write users, role
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: User bị vô hiệu hóa, không thể login

note over Actor,DB
Pre: User tồn tại
Post: User bị vô hiệu hóa, không thể login
Main flow:
1. Admin chọn user
2. Admin bấm Disable
3. System gọi API PATCH /auth/users/:userId/disable
4. User bị set isActive = false
end note
@enduml
